OL,3,GNEWSABoy who lost four fingers in
OL,4,Afirework blast issues Bonfire Night
OL,5,Awarning
OL,6,
OL,7,FA schoolboy who lost four fingers after
OL,8,Fa firework went off in his hand has
OL,9,Fwarned other youngsters not to mess
OL,10,Fabout with pyrotechnics ahead of
OL,11,FBonfire Night.
OL,13,FRiley Luke was eight years old when he
OL,14,Fand a group of friends found the
OL,15,Fdiscarded firework near their homes in
OL,16,FPaisley, Renfrewshire.
OL,18,FThey were handing it around and trying
OL,19,Fto light it when it exploded in Riley's
OL,20,Fhand.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
